    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a0c336718b5f5444124d82",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辛苦您了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c971fa6ea4bd07e506c244e4115372e39db5db3b686990ee28d3d7e606174dd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "80000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/80000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45d9ff6ea9a58deb6a6e357",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上好。从清晨\n就能见到您…仿佛内心的阴霾\n都被照亮般的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7458ccbf8c67be9b0417ea5b6e63de58bce4a6a4800e5cb8b11545f2b1fcdee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a291b0f20c17fb30a334caf8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呜…阳光变得强烈了呢\n或许…想稍微\n到阴凉处去…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f77ba7091435d6e8728b6e0c0611a19c07291ecace9fcd07a4377e8e86511467",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba6227d8ee77ca21f6da427",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "午餐时，定时器是必须的\n…没有的话，细细品味的时候\n休息时间就会结束…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f785189bb0193557b8b777d0c5038ec0312f725fc29989b4e4bb7b13208aae4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f1546071622066074ada2c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我做了些点心，如果您愿意\n请品尝…如果合您口味…\n我会非常…幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8f52cd65e3e7efd32fee71f9628575d18447b58911751cb51fb0f580d68cb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9215a44190f51f447bf7420b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想和您静静眺望每日变换身姿的月亮\n但满月之时，或许会\n唤醒那孩子呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5e12ef27ece7be8449d5dbeb261aa7e2cdf2f154281525c5bd3ebe307a74f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9959bfd43bb728c714fd059c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜晚，很温柔…\n不想被看见的东西，\n也会被夜幕隐藏…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db9ce775e1fc18b2338b52c93f6134b1ccc72ec574a4fdd3e1600af3399a46a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90d91cba589d57ba75e2a12",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春夏秋冬的轮回，再次开始…\n…无论季节如何变迁，在您心中\n是否有我的容身之处…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "692d9379bcf30cdc3fd920172ad84dba0e79b944db19f4b655b363008ee13d55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d32c48c28dff6890aefafc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "暂时要避免无意中站在暗处\n…那个，试胆的季节\n尤其…容易被误认为是幽灵…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9196f0edb1a52043402938bdabed456129acc80a3aa1f8a127690db83d4bb45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
