      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喜欢在书海中让心灵畅游幻想\n…特别是历史小说会将我\n带往古老的时代。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b61bcd116903fa371d5090ca23b7f083d5d0356f101be9f62e49c7b34a87672",
